msgid "Generate SqDRIFT circuits {#generate-sqdrift-circuits}"
msgstr "Générer des circuits SqDRIFT {#generate-sqdrift-circuits}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With sample-based quantum diagonalization ([SQD](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.05068)), you must choose an ansatz from which to sample bitstrings. The [SqDRIFT](https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.02578) variant uses an ensemble of time evolution circuits constructed directly from the target Hamiltonian instead. This is achieved by subsampling smaller time evolution operators from the Hamiltonian based on its coefficients, which is known as the [qDRIFT](https://arxiv.org/abs/1811.08017) Trotterization method.\n"
msgstr "Avec la diagonalisation quantique par échantillonnage ([SQD](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.05068)), tu dois choisir un ansatz à partir duquel échantillonner des chaînes de bits. La variante [SqDRIFT](https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.02578) utilise à la place un ensemble de circuits d'évolution temporelle construits directement à partir de l'hamiltonien cible. Cela s'obtient en sous-échantillonnant de plus petits opérateurs d'évolution temporelle de l'hamiltonien d'après ses coefficients, ce qu'on appelle la méthode de Trotterisation [qDRIFT](https://arxiv.org/abs/1811.08017).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This getting started guide shows how to generate an ensemble of such randomized circuits.\n"
msgstr "Ce guide de prise en main montre comment générer un ensemble de tels circuits randomisés.\n"

