#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"hamiltonian-setup\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. Hamiltonian setup {#1-hamiltonian-setup}"
msgstr "1. Configuration de l'hamiltonien {#1-hamiltonian-setup}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For the purposes of this guide, load the electronic structure Hamiltonian of N2 from an FCIDUMP file. There are other means of constructing the [`FermionOperator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/operators-fermion-operator#qiskit_fermions.operators.FermionOperator \"qiskit_fermions.operators.FermionOperator\"). Be sure to consult its documentation, as well as the [`qiskit_fermions.operators.library`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/operators-library#module-qiskit_fermions.operators.library \"qiskit_fermions.operators.library\").\n"
msgstr "Pour les besoins de ce guide, charge l'hamiltonien de structure électronique de N2 depuis un fichier FCIDUMP. Il existe d'autres moyens de construire le [`FermionOperator`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/operators-fermion-operator#qiskit_fermions.operators.FermionOperator \"qiskit_fermions.operators.FermionOperator\"). Consulte sa documentation, ainsi que [`qiskit_fermions.operators.library`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/operators-library#module-qiskit_fermions.operators.library \"qiskit_fermions.operators.library\").\n"

